<h1>Review discontinued products</h1><p><%= supplier.name %> · <%= notice.reference %></p>
<p>Stops reordering these products, sells down any stock left, archives each one when none is left and records the checked replacement for staff. It never writes off stock, changes a selling price without your approval or substitutes items on any order.</p>
<% if(problem||notice.last_issue){ %><p class="notice"><%= problem||notice.last_issue %></p><% } %><% if(shadow){ %><p class="notice">The first 14 days are Watch only. Retirement and authority changes are paused.</p><% } %>
<section class="card"><h2>Exact recorded products</h2><ul><% for(const pair of notice.source_snapshot.pairs){ %><li><%= pair.old.code %> — <%= pair.old.name %> → <%= pair.replacement.code %> — <%= pair.replacement.name %></li><% } %></ul>
<% if(notice.applied_at){ %><p>Retired <%= helpers.dateTime(notice.applied_at) %> · <%= notice.automatic?'Within owner-authorized supplier scope':'Individually approved' %>.</p><% for(const pair of notice.result.items){ %><p><a href="/inventory/<%= pair.oldItemId %>">Open <%= pair.oldCode %> and its replacement guidance</a></p><% } %><% }else{ %>
<form method="post" action="/autopilot/discontinued-products/<%= notice.id %>/apply" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="sourceFingerprint" value="<%= freshFingerprint||'' %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> I approve retiring these exact products and recording these replacement links.</label><button class="btn" <%= shadow||!freshFingerprint?'disabled':'' %>>Apply reviewed product retirements</button></form><% } %></section>
<section class="card"><h2>Future checked notices from this supplier</h2><p>Only new notices recorded after you grant authority qualify. Every original supplier notice must still be checked before recording. Pro needs an individually approved completed example; Custom can authorize the scope without training.</p>
<form method="post" action="/autopilot/discontinued-products/suppliers/<%= supplier.id %>/settings" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= setting?.revision||0 %>"><input type="hidden" name="supplierFingerprint" value="<%= supplierFingerprint %>">
<label class="rm-field"><span>Maximum products in one notice</span><input name="maximumProducts" type="number" min="1" max="100" value="<%= setting?.maximum_products||'' %>" required></label>
<% if(notice.applied_at&&!notice.automatic){ %><label><input type="checkbox" name="exampleId" value="<%= notice.id %>"> Teach this supplier scope from my completed approval, using the product limit entered above.</label><% } %>
<label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> I authorize retirement only for future checked notices from this supplier, inside this product limit, with no unfinished purchase orders. This never grants stock write-off or order-substitution authority.</label>
<% if(plan==='pro'&&!setting?.taught_notice_id&&!notice.applied_at){ %><p>Apply one reviewed notice before teaching automatic retirement on Pro.</p><% } %>
<button class="btn" <%= shadow||plan==='pro'&&!setting?.taught_notice_id&&!notice.applied_at?'disabled':'' %>>Enable scoped product retirement</button></form>
<% if(setting?.enabled){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/discontinued-products/suppliers/<%= supplier.id %>/settings"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= setting.revision %>"><button class="btn" name="stop" value="yes">Stop automatic retirement</button></form><% } %></section><p>AI credits used: 0.</p>
